Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Soo-hyun - Kim Ji-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Park Sung-hoon - Kwak Dong-yeon - Lee Joo-bin{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Gab-soo - Lee Mi-sook{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jung Jin-young - Na Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jeon Bae-soo - Hwang Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Jung-nan - Kim Joo-ryoung{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jang Yoon-ju - Kim Do-hyun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Screenwriter: Park Ji-eun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Directors: Jang Young-woo - Kim Hee-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen of Tears{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.64,0:01:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me this isn't true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.61,0:01:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Divorce Settlement Agreement{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.61,0:01:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.11,0:01:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Deny it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.91,0:01:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hae-in...\N- Say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.95,0:01:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me it's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.75,0:01:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me it wasn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.30,0:01:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.68,0:01:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I couldn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.45,0:02:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,When?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,When...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.84,0:02:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you prepare this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.34,0:02:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I have...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.55,0:02:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}something to say.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.89,0:02:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.77,0:02:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,that day?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.31,0:02:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The day I told you I was dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.69,0:02:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.41,0:02:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.37,0:02:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,you kept...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.75,0:02:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,your mouth shut,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and didn't tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.67,0:02:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I was going to die soon, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.67,0:03:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.52,0:03:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.36,0:03:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,you lied all along?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lied through your teeth,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.92,0:03:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,so what's stopping you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.40,0:03:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I found it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.52,0:04:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,on my way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lock is still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.72,0:05:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.31,0:05:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late to go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.78,0:05:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay here. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.49,0:05:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.83,0:05:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.12,0:05:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even have...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.17,0:05:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,the energy to get angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.42,0:05:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.72,0:05:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you why I did that,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.55,0:05:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,what I was feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.47,0:05:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and what my plan was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.73,0:05:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.73,0:06:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.27,0:06:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I love you, Hong Hae-in.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.61,0:06:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I love you.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.99,0:06:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Are you okay?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.53,0:08:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.99,0:08:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know you should be more careful?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.01,0:08:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do as you say,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.26,0:08:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- so...\N- Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If this ever happens again,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.32,0:08:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,don't save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.32,0:09:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm so shocked.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.49,0:09:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo was normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.83,0:09:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I thought he'd been out of his mind lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.25,0:09:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}since he seemed to truly love Hae-in,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.58,0:09:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}but he was just like any other guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.67,0:09:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I was surprised too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.29,0:09:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Who knew he was planning\Nto divorce her in secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.59,0:10:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}- I wonder when it all began.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.14,0:10:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Someone must've encouraged him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.81,0:10:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I've been suspecting someone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.72,0:10:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.56,0:10:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}My aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.44,0:10:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.28,0:10:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.28,0:10:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been getting in my way\Nand talking nonsense lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.03,0:10:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,about Hyun-woo's being more handsome than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.91,0:10:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Recently it seemed like those\Ntwo were sharing a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.08,0:10:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw them last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.79,0:10:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}The biggest priority of this business...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.59,0:10:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- What's going on?\N- So why didn't you go?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.84,0:10:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Why did she go alone?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.64,0:10:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Why did you let her go alone?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.89,0:10:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Send who alone?\N- Why?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.98,0:10:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}What? Why is she crying?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.85,0:10:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They were having a serious talk in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.53,0:10:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what it was about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.31,0:12:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.39,0:12:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The treatment fell through, so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.06,0:12:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What he means is that we need time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.07,0:12:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's return to Korea,\Nraise your WBC, then return...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.82,0:12:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're despicable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.36,0:12:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're happy I'm dying,\Nand have given up everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.00,0:12:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You've given up everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.16,0:13:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So you won't bother trying anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What about a lawsuit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.59,0:13:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be grateful if you divorced me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.59,0:13:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,without filing a suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- You know everything now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't let me go that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.31,0:13:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It was unbearable to live with you, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.73,0:13:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't act like you had no idea, Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.78,0:13:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what kind of person you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.62,0:13:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder I chose to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.70,0:13:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I could've lived a comfortable and wealthy life,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.87,0:13:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,so why did I want to run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.67,0:14:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I hated living\Nwith you more than anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.43,0:14:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.47,0:14:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Baek Hyun-woo.\N- Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.39,0:14:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,When I heard you'd be dying soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.52,0:14:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was relieved deep down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.40,0:14:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd have a clean divorce\Nif I put up with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.69,0:14:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,for the next three months,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but I got caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.95,0:14:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.71,0:14:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If you choose...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,not to take any action\Nat all and just divorce me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,then honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.93,0:14:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.06,0:14:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.98,0:15:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.19,0:15:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I pack up and leave once we return?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.53,0:15:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.53,0:15:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,if I continue to grovel at your\Nfeet, will you revise your will?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.50,0:15:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you can handle this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.21,0:15:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can handle my rage?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.93,0:15:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What'll you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something if you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.13,0:16:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Song has gone through his\Nfirst round of interrogations,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.93,0:16:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but our attorneys doubt the\Nprosecution will stop here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.43,0:16:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's how the prosecution will proceed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.02,0:16:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,then it'll only be a matter of\Ntime until they summon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.19,0:16:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this mess we're in, thanks to Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about their summoning you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.11,0:16:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to take your medications on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.28,0:16:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can go instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.95,0:16:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sorry?\N- What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.12,0:16:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I was behind bars for ten months\Nwhen I was Soo-cheol's age.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.08,0:16:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I was as young as Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you looking at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an experience you\Ncan't even buy with money.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.43,0:17:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.64,0:17:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If you appear in his stead,\Npeople will think you're the heir,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.27,0:17:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but if you don't, they'll think you're terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.38,0:17:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a family to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.27,0:17:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.15,0:17:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's me. You should protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.11,0:17:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.61,0:17:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.78,0:17:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem is that we have an\Nimportant investment deal coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,If the investors find out,\Nthe deal might fall through.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right, sir. We should hasten the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.54,0:17:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a whole feast prepared in front of us...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.42,0:17:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,that could be taken by Chairman Yeom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.09,0:17:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The reporters will find out sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.46,0:17:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yoon will opt out immediately, then,\Nand that's what Chairman Yeom wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.63,0:17:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,First we need to secure the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.02,0:17:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandfather!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Queens Mart Enters New Resort Business{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.32,0:18:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the construction begins,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.83,0:18:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll insinuate the licensing issue\Nrelated to altitude restrictions...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.50,0:18:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,to the investors.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.25,0:18:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the investors and stock\Nfirms who gave out loans...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.75,0:18:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,will choose the pre-payment option.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.71,0:18:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol, that coward, will be shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.71,0:18:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He might even cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.55,0:19:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when I'll offer to invest the amount...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.34,0:19:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the investors have pulled out,\Nand suggest convertible bonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.76,0:19:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is when the prosecution will investigate?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.73,0:19:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.73,0:19:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the embezzlement news gets\Nout and the Hong family goes to jail,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.75,0:19:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use the convertible bonds\Nto purchase Queens' stocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.11,0:19:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll combine that with\Nthe 4.9% I previously purchased,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.57,0:19:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and become the biggest shareholder.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.28,0:19:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is panning out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.66,0:19:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Hyun-woo is out of the picture now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.25,0:19:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew we'd find the divorce\Npapers at this perfect timing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.09,0:19:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Hyun-woo admit to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.42,0:19:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he sign the divorce papers?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.13,0:19:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why bother asking? Of course it was him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.09,0:19:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you even wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.85,0:19:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,They should just divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.64,0:19:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He bugged your room and gave\Nthe tapes to the prosecution,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.60,0:19:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can look past them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.44,0:19:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.10,0:19:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Our family is awfully tolerant\Nof their parents' sufferings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.36,0:19:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,One thing I don't understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.57,0:20:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,is that the scumbag wanted to divorce her first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.86,0:20:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the one thing I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there's someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.24,0:20:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps a mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.21,0:20:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- Father, I'll look into it.\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.71,0:20:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- The audit team will.\N- They will?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.50,0:20:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll leave Queens after the divorce.\NI need to find out before then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.92,0:20:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll look through his computer,\Nfinancial documents, phone, and account.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll track his funds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.93,0:20:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find out who he met\Nand what he's been up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment I find any\Nembezzlement or illegal act,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.02,0:20:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll report him, and file a claim for damages.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.31,0:20:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- You'll go that far?\N- Yes, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.32,0:20:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it, so\Nplease don't get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.63,0:20:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She sure is merciless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I'd pick you up at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.38,0:21:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.38,0:21:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.63,0:21:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.76,0:21:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your eardrums can pop when you're beaten.\NIt happens to many of my clients.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.89,0:21:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.39,0:21:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.56,0:21:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're okay. You're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.23,0:21:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.94,0:21:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here. Let me give you a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You should've feigned innocence,\Nsince you were acting anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,"The divorce papers are nothing."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.79,0:21:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"I was just practicing to\Nbecome a divorce attorney."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.12,0:21:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you have improvised?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.50,0:21:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}She must be livid. I'll bet\Nshe's even more terrifying now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bet you're dispirited.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.30,0:21:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Available for Monthly Rent{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.51,0:21:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You worked so hard pretending to be in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.80,0:21:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You must feel hopeless now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.84,0:21:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.10,0:21:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you mean?\N- She wasn't angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.89,0:21:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- Right,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.35,0:21:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and I don't feel hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.81,0:22:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm upset.\N- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.06,0:22:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in no position to feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.86,0:22:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in cried.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.61,0:22:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She did,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.44,0:22:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and it drove me insane...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.78,0:22:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,seeing her crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.33,0:22:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.12,0:22:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,did I do to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.21,0:22:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.21,0:22:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he couldn't stand being next to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.38,0:22:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he have feelings for her, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.05,0:22:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's your next move?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.97,0:22:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- What move?\N- Do you have no plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.31,0:22:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She's probably planning something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.64,0:22:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.19,0:22:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You upset her big-time, so I'll\Nbet she's thinking of the best way...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.65,0:22:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,to take revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.94,0:22:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.57,0:22:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- She should.\N- What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.15,0:22:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,She needs that motivation.\NShe needs to focus on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.66,0:22:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So you purposely let her\Nfocus on ruining your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.03,0:22:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a sacrifice?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.37,0:22:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a soldier running into a losing battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.33,0:23:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}If this ever happens again,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.87,0:23:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}don't save me.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.46,0:23:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only way she'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.82,0:23:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.40,0:23:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.53,0:23:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on my way to see your\Ngrandfather. Let's talk later.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.28,0:23:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be me, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.95,0:23:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- What do you mean?\N- Try all you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.83,0:23:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but the heir will always be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.33,0:23:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You still don't get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.08,0:23:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you that jealous of me,\Nthat you'd bug his room?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.59,0:23:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you want to know all the\Nconversations we were having?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.67,0:23:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.13,0:23:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- I didn't bug his room.\N- I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.13,0:23:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Get what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.84,0:23:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you were up to\Nsomething when you put up...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.72,0:23:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,with everything Hae-in did,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.18,0:24:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but what now? You got caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.02,0:24:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I was planning to give you something\Nonce this resort deal became a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.32,0:24:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"I should set up a branch in Yufuin or Cancún,"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.11,0:24:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,"and send him there."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.41,0:24:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,"No, Yufuin is too near."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.57,0:24:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hae-in would just need to fly an hour."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.83,0:24:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,"He should go to Cancún if he wants freedom."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.95,0:24:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how much I cared about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.34,0:24:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.34,0:24:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to halt the resort construction.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.96,0:24:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The consulting firm Mr. Yoon introduced...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.51,0:24:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,predicted an annual profit of $500 million,\Nbut the actual figure was $89 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.85,0:24:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's less than 20%. Isn't that odd?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.26,0:24:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You signed the contract\Neven before the validity test...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.23,0:24:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're trying to get in the way again!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.27,0:24:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop worrying about my success.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.49,0:24:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget! It'll be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.41,0:25:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for worrying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.92,0:25:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, do explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.29,0:25:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you hide the divorce papers?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.71,0:25:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you going to surprise us with it later on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.42,0:25:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why you've been nitpicking\Nmy words and disobeying me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.76,0:25:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because of those papers?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.60,0:25:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, the chairman wants to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.51,0:25:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.60,0:25:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Please leave all your electronics outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.52,0:25:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.06,0:25:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You could be recording even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.75,0:25:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What did Chairman Yeom promise you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.25,0:25:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sorry?\N- The divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.59,0:25:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't care less about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.84,0:25:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You chose to ruin your luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.78,0:25:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.84,0:25:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you bugged my room,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.22,0:26:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and Chairman Yeom handed\Nit over to the prosecution,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.72,0:26:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.10,0:26:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you scheme Mr. Song's embezzlement, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.48,0:26:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you targeting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.31,0:26:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true that the embezzlement\Nwas targeted at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.82,0:26:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you playing smart with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.48,0:26:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm asking if you were behind it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.41,0:26:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Director Jo Hyeon-myeong approved\NMr. Song's embezzlement files.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.12,0:26:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The man next to him has been in\Ncharge of Queens' external audit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.97,0:26:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He is Hwang Byeong-u who\Nhas his own accounting firm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.46,0:26:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- They went to the same college.\N- So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.38,0:26:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been doing yearly audits,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.88,0:26:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's odd that he found no issues until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.38,0:26:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Has his accounting firm...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.76,0:26:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,truly been unaware of Mr. Song's\Nembezzlement for the past five years?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.86,0:26:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}So you're telling me Jo Hyeon-myeong\Nschemed with his firm,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.90,0:27:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}and turned a blind eye to the embezzlement?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.32,0:27:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}So I'd be investigated?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.24,0:27:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}No, sir.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.41,0:27:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Director Jo didn't do this\Nalone. Someone ordered him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.08,0:27:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that individual bugged your\Nroom and planted the transmitter in mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.46,0:27:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And who is this person?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.64,0:27:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't found out yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.18,0:27:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.22,0:27:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not even sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.39,0:27:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}yet you want me to believe you after\Nwhat you did to my granddaughter?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.27,0:27:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Do you?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.60,0:27:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Director Jo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.73,0:27:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You should hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.07,0:27:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Because Baek Hyun-woo is after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.33,0:27:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Estimated Assets $2,386.69{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.42,0:28:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you doing stocks again?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.17,0:28:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The market is a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.55,0:28:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how blue it gets,\Nas long as my baby is red.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.35,0:28:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Queens Department Store{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.10,0:28:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's red.\N- What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.44,0:28:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who's your baby?\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.48,0:28:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on. Tell me.\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.36,0:28:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.98,0:28:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.36,0:28:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.94,0:28:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You bought Queens' stocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.07,0:28:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom would kill me, so be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.82,0:28:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you buy them?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.79,0:28:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I had them in the past, but I sold them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.37,0:28:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- When?\N- When Hyun-woo mentioned the divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.42,0:28:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't ignore the owner's risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.67,0:28:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing good would've come out of\Nthe media's mentioning their divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.43,0:28:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How sly of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.34,0:28:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you bought them again when\NHyun-woo decided not to divorce?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.30,0:28:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.31,0:28:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's going up, right?\N- Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.10,0:28:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.52,0:28:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unlike you to take a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.57,0:29:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.73,0:29:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gosh.\N- What was it about?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.57,0:29:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It was ambiguous.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.78,0:29:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What was it? Maybe it was a conception dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.22,0:29:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo's a dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.28,0:29:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't anything cute like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.84,0:29:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Mom{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.55,0:29:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hello?\N- Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.72,0:29:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this Mr. Baek Hyun-woo's phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.18,0:29:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.64,0:29:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Hae-in's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.73,0:29:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Ms. Kim. How have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.27,0:29:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Hyun-woo left his phone behind,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.86,0:29:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- {\i1}but why are you...?{\i0}\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.32,0:29:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He's speaking with my father-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.40,0:29:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know if you know,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.11,0:29:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but Hyun-woo turned our family upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.74,0:29:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.16,0:29:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My father-in-law's room was bugged...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.21,0:29:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.75,0:30:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know Hyun-woo wanted a divorce?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.05,0:30:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He did mention it before,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.09,0:30:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but it's normal for a married couple...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.35,0:30:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,to go through rough patches.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.09,0:30:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought they'd resolved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.60,0:30:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,She knows about the divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.68,0:30:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.73,0:30:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You should hear them out first.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.65,0:30:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You told me not to get in their way...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.61,0:30:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,on the day they got married,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.44,0:30:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but you see, I'll make sure they part ways,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.24,0:30:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so don't get in my way.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.82,0:30:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, what did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.33,0:30:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.70,0:30:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness. What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.54,0:30:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.00,0:30:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.01,0:30:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.89,0:30:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What if he really gets a divorce?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.31,0:31:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.69,0:31:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Sell{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.40,0:31:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Your order is complete{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.19,0:31:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I sold them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.19,0:31:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.90,0:31:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do what they did with the apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.74,0:31:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong can take a bite of your pear and say,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.41,0:31:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,"Gosh, that's sweet."\NThat's all she needs to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.54,0:31:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I should ask her for help again?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.04,0:31:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She was supposed to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.13,0:31:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the ones who took advantage of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.38,0:31:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your take on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.09,0:31:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already incredible...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.92,0:31:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,that she made time to come down here and flex,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.89,0:31:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and you want to ask her for help again?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.01,0:31:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.18,0:31:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Exactly.\N- You'll lose face.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.81,0:31:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.35,0:31:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Then will you let Park Seok-hun take everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.81,0:31:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're always so extreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.23,0:31:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you an INFP?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.53,0:31:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? I'm Park Chun-sik.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.78,0:31:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about your goals.\NWill you do anything to reach them?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.87,0:31:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Or does the process matter more?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.58,0:32:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,INFP or ENFJ.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.04,0:32:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.67,0:32:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an INFP.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.30,0:32:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Then feed her some pears\Nand tell her to comment on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.26,0:32:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,First we need to remove the\Nvideo of her eating the apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.80,0:32:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want enemies stealing your food,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.85,0:32:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- don't set the table in front of them.\N- That does make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.56,0:32:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, why haven't you been picking up?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.48,0:32:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's out of battery. I'm glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.31,0:32:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Take down that video of Hae-in eating the apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.98,0:32:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I already have.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.11,0:32:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the issue. I have bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.40,0:32:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.70,0:32:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.49,0:32:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll all find out eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.91,0:32:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.42,0:32:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness. What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.34,0:32:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,They're getting a divorce?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.75,0:32:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyeon-tae, do you have any anxiety pills?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.09,0:32:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Of course not.\N- That's not the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.93,0:32:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He should overcome it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.55,0:32:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.47,0:33:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this entertaining for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.14,0:33:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I'd like to use Dr. Oh's\Nsolution in this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.31,0:33:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Episode 58, the one with Nancy Lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.90,0:33:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Oh mentioned three steps\Nto overcome hardships in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.03,0:33:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- I saw it, but forgot.\N- Step one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.97,0:33:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Acknowledgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.03,0:33:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Accurately assess the current crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.70,0:33:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they hand in the divorce papers?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.49,0:33:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.71,0:33:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Step two. Self-awareness.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.33,0:33:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Find out how bad the situation is\Nand how much worse it could get.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.67,0:33:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Were there any articles or tabloids?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.96,0:33:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet, but it'll only\Nbe a matter of time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.76,0:33:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.76,0:33:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And lastly, sorting it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.85,0:33:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Decide what you'll give up on\Nand what you'll keep. Then act on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.06,0:33:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares about the election anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.31,0:33:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.94,0:33:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where are you going?\N- Where's your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.57,0:33:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,She just left. I don't know where she went.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.07,0:34:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you have to mention the election right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.03,0:34:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.12,0:34:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an INTP.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.83,0:34:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Yongdu-ri Supermarket{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.63,0:34:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.71,0:34:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo's mom knew everything and lied to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.22,0:34:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare they upload that video\Nof Hae-in, when she knew nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.05,0:34:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.18,0:34:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Be calm as her mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.97,0:34:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine how Hae-in must feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.89,0:34:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Seon-hwa!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.52,0:34:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.60,0:34:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Hyun-woo really do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.15,0:34:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You were always defending him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.73,0:34:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.15,0:34:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a poor judge of character.\NNo wonder you're always betrayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.20,0:34:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't blame me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.03,0:34:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll always be duped if\Nsomeone is determined to trick you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.79,0:34:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Why shouldn't I tell anyone?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.48,0:34:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}That wench has been\Ndeceiving us for over 20 years!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.68,0:34:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Exactly.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.75,0:34:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}That just proves how savage she is.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.55,0:34:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}If you don't have proof,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.59,0:35:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}she'll just deny it and turn you into a fool.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.05,0:35:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Let's be patient. She has a son,\Nso she must be sending him money.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.01,0:35:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Let's find him first.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.31,0:35:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}In the meantime, keep your temper under control.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.48,0:35:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}You must.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.36,0:35:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be able to relate,\Nsince I'm not a mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.07,0:35:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but then again, I guess the same goes for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.08,0:35:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to be a mom to relate.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.75,0:35:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can imagine how she must feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.67,0:35:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, think twice about the divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.33,0:35:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I know times have changed,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.54,0:35:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but Hae-in will suffer more\Nthan him if they divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.88,0:35:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Take her, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.97,0:35:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you looking at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.14,0:35:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike her ex-husbands\Nwho've all happily remarried,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.22,0:35:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Beom-ja is still single.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.89,0:35:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.14,0:35:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I remarried right away, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.19,0:35:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And you divorced just as quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.27,0:35:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Seon-hwa, that's not the problem right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.23,0:35:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Hae-in? What's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.99,0:36:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, she's already struggling as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.49,0:36:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,She's already struggling?\NIs something going on with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.00,0:36:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.12,0:36:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She's just a workaholic.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.00,0:36:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She needs to take a breather. Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.13,0:36:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.13,0:36:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's she saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.64,0:37:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There. I signed it too,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.31,0:37:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's up to me when and how I'll submit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.69,0:37:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.32,0:37:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can finally understand why...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.03,0:37:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,my aunt beat her ex-husbands\Nto a pulp before the divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.70,0:37:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hire much more competent\Nattorneys than she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.90,0:37:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't leave this house unscathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.53,0:37:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be kicked out mercilessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.37,0:37:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.12,0:37:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.43,0:37:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But please keep your\Ndistance from Yoon Eun-sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.31,0:37:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.31,0:37:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He was out of touch for a long\Ntime then suddenly appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.65,0:38:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he gifted Soo-cheol\Nand you a hefty investment,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.77,0:38:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Hercyna deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.78,0:38:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have a motive.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.07,0:38:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- He's suspicious too.\N- How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.99,0:38:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There was dashcam footage\Nof the hunting-ground incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.20,0:38:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave the SD card to a\Ndata-restoration company.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.83,0:38:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Yoon visited them,\Nand the owner has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.88,0:38:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So? How does that prove anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.84,0:38:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He could've simply been another client,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.55,0:38:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,and even if he has something up his sleeve,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.05,0:38:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,he won't fool me that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.06,0:38:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.15,0:38:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't make the same mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.55,0:39:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We've prepared pine\Nmushroom porridge for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.51,0:39:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Would you like some?\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.80,0:39:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I want beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.20,0:40:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong's diamond necklace blinded me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.00,0:40:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a peacock at large.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.54,0:40:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Brace yourselves.\N- Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.13,0:40:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but what peacock?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.96,0:40:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. You're a newbie here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.38,0:40:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How did Ms. Hong look?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.84,0:40:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.84,0:40:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.09,0:40:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, just remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.14,0:40:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The more upset she is, the fancier she dresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.35,0:40:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She looked like a fabulous peacock today.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.81,0:40:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It means we're all dead meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.06,0:40:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.65,0:40:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There's...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.32,0:40:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}no solution.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.78,0:40:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Natural disasters and Ms. Hong's moodiness\Nare two things humans can't control.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.20,0:41:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.79,0:41:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll reprint these documents, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.67,0:41:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.44,0:41:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.53,0:41:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.59,0:41:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. It's not a life-or-death situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.22,0:41:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't feel so bad about spilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.26,0:41:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. You may go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.64,0:41:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong, are you very upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.52,0:41:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I have something that enrages me much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.19,0:41:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.23,0:41:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.40,0:41:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Even this sloppy report...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.28,0:41:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't enrage me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.95,0:41:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She was so terrifying, even when not angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.08,0:41:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what she's enraged about.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.54,0:41:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We're from the audit team.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.84,0:41:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We're conducting an investigation...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.71,0:41:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,after receiving a report on\Nthe illegal use of expenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.76,0:41:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.85,0:42:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't shred any documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.18,0:42:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't destroy or move anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.99,0:42:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, this is total bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.66,0:42:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Has the Hong-Baek Battle begun once again?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.95,0:42:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.29,0:42:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.84,0:42:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- All of them?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.13,0:42:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're going to reject them?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.80,0:42:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But you already confirmed\Nthem before going to Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.51,0:42:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.18,0:42:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- All of them?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.77,0:42:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,She rejected them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.52,0:42:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It usually lasts a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.56,0:42:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The duration isn't the problem this time around.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.36,0:42:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The intensity is on another level.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.69,0:42:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world happened in Germany?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.86,0:42:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's share their schedules.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.86,0:42:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them run into each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.53,0:43:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What? The lunch meeting. We're\Nhaving sushi at J Hotel, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.53,0:43:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Change it. I'll follow your\Nschedule for the elevator rides.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.62,0:43:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.87,0:43:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Baek Hyun-woo{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.38,0:43:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Queens Department Store Inc.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.99,0:43:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"We've already reviewed the contracts\Nfor the soon-to-be-closed stores,"
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.15,0:43:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,"so you can proceed."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.17,0:43:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,"We've already discussed this,\Nso you can't change it."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.06,0:43:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,"You'll have to pay triple\Nthe penalty fee if you do."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.06,0:43:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,"Please approve it, so we can proceed."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.78,0:43:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,"Goodbye, then."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.36,0:43:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.07,0:43:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,"The legal team can take care of\Npenalty issues. I can't approve this."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.70,0:43:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,"Shouldn't you have come up..."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.70,0:43:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,"with different scenarios\Nregarding the possible issues,"
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.54,0:43:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"run simulations, and then\Nreported them to me? Again."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.17,0:43:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.13,0:43:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- How feisty.\N- Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.76,0:43:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.63,0:44:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't we having sushi at J Hotel today?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.30,0:44:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.47,0:44:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How about the Chinese restaurant instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.43,0:44:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.06,0:44:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd cost a lot for us all\Nto have sushi {\i1}omakase.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.85,0:44:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. It's my treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.94,0:44:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how hard you've been working.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.07,0:44:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just have Chinese, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.28,0:44:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Their sweet-and-sour\Npork lunch set is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.24,0:44:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why so suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.70,0:44:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there another reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.70,0:44:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.00,0:44:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They all prefer to have Chinese instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.67,0:44:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}What's with Mr. Kim's face?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.13,0:44:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}He's going to kill us if we choose sushi.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.26,0:44:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}I'll bet it's because Ms. Hong is going there.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.26,0:44:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}I think Mr. Baek caught onto it.\NI thought he loved{\i0} jajangmyeon.{\c}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.06,0:44:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}This is entertaining.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.27,0:44:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}I don't care what we have.\NI just want to watch the rich argue.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.44,0:44:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Me too me too{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.40,0:44:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}The Owl has switched to Chinese.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.23,0:45:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Okay. The Eagle is headed to\Nthe elevator in Building A.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.61,0:45:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}The Owl is headed to Building B.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.91,0:45:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's running late. Let's go to Building B.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.04,0:45:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But it'll be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.00,0:45:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}The Eagle has changed course.\NApproaching Building B in three minutes.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.09,0:45:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we walk instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.18,0:45:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's very healthy to take the stairs.\N- Not if you're going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.15,0:45:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Emergency.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.15,0:45:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Ms. Hong is coming this way! Help!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.33,0:45:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in the chatroom too.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.46,0:45:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.30,0:46:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys must be eating out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.64,0:46:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not have much to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.60,0:46:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm treating them, since\Nthey have a lot of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.22,0:46:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.48,0:46:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You should do better,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.02,0:46:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and while you're at it,\Ngive me an analysis report...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.60,0:46:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,on the cases you've repeatedly lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.28,0:46:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,in the past three years,\Nand find out how to improve.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.32,0:46:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.74,0:46:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,but when you review it,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.03,0:46:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you leave out any\Npersonal feelings you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.53,0:46:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.95,0:46:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty much an AI...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.37,0:46:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,when it comes to work,\Nso don't worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.91,0:46:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.62,0:46:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That ignorance of yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.00,0:46:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,is the reason you keep losing those cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.74,0:47:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we take the stairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.66,0:47:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sure.\N- Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.46,0:47:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you read the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.59,0:47:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,NSFA's new biotechnology was fabricated?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.42,0:47:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- We invested in them.\N- Did you use your shares as collateral?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.80,0:47:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It was impossible to get the money in cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.43,0:47:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I even signed a foreclosure\Nagreement with the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.43,0:47:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.27,0:47:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What if the bank confiscates our shares?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.15,0:47:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Can you reach Director Jo?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.61,0:47:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, it's sad to see you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.19,0:47:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- People grow on me so easily.\N- Stay healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.49,0:47:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Your kids will be happy to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.24,0:47:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Even more so, since you're rich now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.53,0:47:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting afresh, so I'm\Ngoing to do many good deeds...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.08,0:48:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and help others.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.58,0:48:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.96,0:48:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The statute of limitations...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.46,0:48:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,for financial fraud of\N$100,000 or more is 25 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.46,0:48:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't help others if you're in prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.13,0:48:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,so don't get caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.76,0:48:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet. I'll stay far from\NKorean marts and restaurants.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.51,0:48:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll live well.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.73,0:48:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.73,0:48:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What a filthy scumbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.73,0:48:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he so brazen, after sucking\Nhis long-time colleagues dry?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.11,0:48:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.70,0:48:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What a dirtbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.72,0:48:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Sungmin University Medical Center{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.82,0:49:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Baek Hyun-woo{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.54,0:49:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hae-in.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.31,0:49:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Contact Sungmin Medical Center.\NI need to check something.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.56,0:49:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, Mr. Baek.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.65,0:49:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How have you been? What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.77,0:49:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.19,0:49:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you recognize this watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.32,0:49:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.07,0:50:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a limited edition for Ronde\Nde Frédic's 101st anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.37,0:50:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- Only 101 of them were made.\N- I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.74,0:50:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But this one is pre-ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.04,0:50:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see this yellow diamond?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.71,0:50:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This diamond was only added to the\Ndials of the ten pre-ordered watches.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.59,0:50:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's a lot to ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.05,0:50:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but may I know who bought those ten watches?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.59,0:50:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.01,0:50:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You helped my mom resolve\Nthe medical malpractice incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.56,0:50:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm close with HQ's team leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.64,0:50:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.92,0:50:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.98,0:50:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.65,0:50:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look far ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.81,0:50:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- Slowly.\N- Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.82,0:50:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Straighten your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.98,0:50:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Step on the pedal. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.53,0:50:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, turn. Yes, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.45,0:50:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowly. That was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.37,0:50:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.41,0:50:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Like this?\N- Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.16,0:50:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're doing great.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.25,0:50:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're terrific. Are you really a beginner?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.50,0:50:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need these extra wheels,\Nbut he kept insisting.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.67,0:50:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You know him, right? He's a bronze medalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.67,0:51:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes.\N- I should listen to the pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.05,0:51:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone uses the training wheels at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.01,0:51:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be flying without them.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.02,0:51:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.68,0:51:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'll go faster.\N- Okay, but relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.10,0:51:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Slowly. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.98,0:51:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Like this?\N- That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.52,0:51:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Go in a straight line.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.36,0:51:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.78,0:51:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, my son! Soo-cheol!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.36,0:51:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.12,0:51:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.29,0:51:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you guys stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.87,0:51:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would they need to?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.37,0:51:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see all this dirt and cement?\NWhy would you ride here? It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.71,0:51:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't ride this.\N- Come on, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.13,0:51:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Skateboards, bicycles, skis,\Nrollerblades, and kick scooters.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.01,0:51:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't ride any of them because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.14,0:51:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't even let me ride steep\Nslides, so I've had no experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.73,0:51:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you might fall...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.65,0:51:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. I've never fallen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.52,0:51:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.57,0:51:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do you understand how much I doted on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.24,0:52:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why must you fall?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.32,0:52:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.66,0:52:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,As his dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.74,0:52:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I should at least teach\NGeon-u how to ride a bicycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.04,0:52:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's just to teach your son how to ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.54,0:52:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's why?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.62,0:52:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to teach him...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.50,0:52:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,how to ride bicycles,\Nrollerblades, kick scooters,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.50,0:52:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,skateboards, and skis.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.51,0:52:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can just hire someone to teach him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.76,0:52:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you put yourself in danger like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.76,0:52:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Dads are supposed to teach\Ntheir kids these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.06,0:52:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.14,0:52:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- All right.\N- No, Soo-cheol. You'll fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.77,0:52:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- Soo-cheol...\N- Mr. Kim, move the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.94,0:52:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mom, come on.\N- Get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.11,0:52:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Move the car, or I'll crash into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.86,0:52:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.91,0:52:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hello, this is Kevin from Manhattan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.16,0:52:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.16,0:52:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's about the Upper West Side\Napartment. The owner wants to sell it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.17,0:52:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.50,0:53:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then I'll proceed. The contract will\Nbe valid until the end of the month.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.88,0:53:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be here by then?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.97,0:53:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You need to sign it yourself.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.68,0:53:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be there in two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.93,0:53:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, there's something\Nodd I found out about Mr. Baek.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.94,0:53:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.31,0:53:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He kept calling a woman's\Nname on the rooftop garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.94,0:53:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A woman's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.58,0:53:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Yeong-suk.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.96,0:53:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Yeong-suk?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.60,0:53:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Yeong...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.39,0:53:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Come out if you're here.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.48,0:54:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her name is Yeong-suk.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.57,0:54:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- That?\N- He keeps telling her to come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.90,0:54:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.74,0:54:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognize that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.49,0:54:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.90,0:54:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.86,0:54:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been keeping a close eye on\NMr. Baek around the clock lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.15,0:54:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what he's been doing every hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.87,0:54:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The places he went to weren't typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.75,0:54:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he been up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.50,0:55:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What? "Coin baseball"?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.88,0:55:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, five balls for 50 cents.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.88,0:55:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He always goes there after work.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.80,0:55:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- With who?\N- Alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.43,0:55:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it. Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.89,0:55:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's "Grandma's Home Cooking"?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.35,0:55:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They sell home-cooked meals.\NHe has dinner there every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.15,0:55:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- With who?\N- Alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.11,0:55:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I tried their food for research purposes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.78,0:55:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It was delicious. I'd go there alone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.07,0:55:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would he act pitifully and eat alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.70,0:55:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He can always eat at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.41,0:55:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What about two days ago?\NHe came home at midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.21,0:55:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. He enjoyed some pork {\i1}bulgogi...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.05,0:55:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,at Grandma's Home Cooking for dinner,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.63,0:55:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,bought two water bottles at a convenience store,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.74,0:55:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,and went to an elementary school nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.80,0:55:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,At that hour? Was it a secret rendezvous?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.89,0:55:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he was alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.97,0:55:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- What did he do there by himself?\N- He ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.31,0:56:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- He ran?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.77,0:56:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You know teachers punish their\Nstudents by making them do laps.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.15,0:56:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what he was doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.86,0:56:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- What for?\N- Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.28,0:56:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like he's an athlete,\Nbut he even sang and shouted.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.24,0:56:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a bit spooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.08,0:56:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.59,0:56:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,♫ {\i1}Don't ask me why I'm leaving{\i0} ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.97,0:56:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,♫ {\i1}I was{\i0} ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.80,0:56:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,♫ {\i1}such a fool{\i0} ♫
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.43,0:56:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.81,0:56:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, sir. He's not typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.90,0:56:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He met up with a stray cat on his way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.23,0:56:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He said hello and gave it a snack.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.82,0:56:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't expect a mistress,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.44,0:56:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but I did expect to see some tycoons.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.45,0:56:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you do your job properly?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.16,0:56:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to brag, but you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.95,0:57:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so competent, I can locate\Na target even in North Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.62,0:57:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true. He's very tenacious.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.83,0:57:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As the legal director of Queens,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.50,0:57:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,his only rendezvous was with a cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.46,0:57:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Aeong.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.00,0:57:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is?\N- The cat's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.92,0:57:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the most ferocious\Ncat in this neighborhood,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.09,0:57:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,but he named it, and it listens to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.55,0:57:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I also hired a former-CSI\Nhacker to hack his phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.02,0:57:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There were many photos of Aeong.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.86,0:57:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange, right? We thought the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.82,0:57:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of man takes such pretty photos\Nof his woman who he wants to divorce?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.95,0:57:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you look closely, this\Nphoto makes her legs look long.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.33,0:57:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This photo requires a lot of concentration.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.00,0:57:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- This is true love.\N- Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.55,0:58:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he has a woman on the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.56,0:58:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't prove anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.73,0:58:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You've put a tail on him many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.23,0:58:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows to behave well in times like these.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.27,0:58:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.69,0:58:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The numbers will tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.82,0:58:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The audit results will come out soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.49,0:58:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They couldn't find anything at all.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.70,0:58:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They did a thorough check,\Nfrom his consultation fee...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.20,0:58:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,to the litigation expenses, and found nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.04,0:58:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I checked his card details and account,\Nand he surprisingly doesn't spend much.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.50,0:58:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He just often goes to the car wash,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.55,0:58:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- but...\N- But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.63,0:58:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd withdraw thousands of\Ndollars in cash every now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.38,0:58:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.35,0:58:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Another odd thing is he'd always spend $300...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.01,0:58:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,at Moulin Rouge on the day of his withdrawal.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.73,0:58:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Moulin Rouge?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.40,0:58:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- A bar?\N- A flower shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.16,0:59:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He spent $300 today and sent\Nthe flowers to a Kim Min-ji.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.92,0:59:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a female name.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.63,0:59:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- I believe so.\N- I see,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.09,0:59:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,so he bought some flowers\Nand withdrew some cash...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.22,0:59:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,before meeting this Kim Min-ji?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.35,0:59:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.97,0:59:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.35,0:59:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kim Min-ji\NGangju-gu, Seoul{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.06,0:59:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Daughters\NKim Min-ji{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.69,0:59:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}CEO Hong Hae-in of Queens Department Store{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.99,0:59:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.00,0:59:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.16,0:59:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ms. Kim Min-ji?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.08,0:59:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Deal with our customers only.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.84,0:59:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The company already helped with the funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.13,1:00:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You personally sent us flowers and\Ngave us a lot of condolence money,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.47,1:00:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and you even made time to visit.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.72,1:00:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to thank...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.76,1:00:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Mr. Baek has been sending\Ncondolence flowers under your name.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.77,1:00:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a bit touched.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.31,1:00:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.15,1:00:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.78,1:01:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All funeral halls are the same,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.49,1:01:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,but this place is clean and modern.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.82,1:01:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There aren't just chrysanthemums,\Nbut dahlias and tulips too.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.08,1:01:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It brightens up the room.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.66,1:01:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those angels?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.62,1:01:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Rococo style. I like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.58,1:01:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I also like how they have halogen lamps here,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.50,1:01:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but pin lights over her photo.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.55,1:01:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you looking for a funeral hall?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.93,1:01:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.22,1:01:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're looking around so closely.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.31,1:01:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just looking around.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.65,1:01:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.52,1:01:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since we\Ncame to a funeral like this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.11,1:01:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of the funerals we attend...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.24,1:01:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,rarely have family members weeping like them.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.04,1:01:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They're busy consulting their\Nattorneys or accountants...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.08,1:01:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,about their inheritance or gift tax.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.63,1:02:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.80,1:02:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.72,1:02:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They're genuinely mourning.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.99,1:02:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you send flowers...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.33,1:02:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and the condolence money?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.96,1:02:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop playing. You disgust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.63,1:02:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I lose my memory down the road,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.17,1:02:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget what you did to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.01,1:02:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You let go of my hand when I was...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.39,1:02:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,the most helpless.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.18,1:02:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.14,1:03:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Try all you want,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.65,1:03:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll resent you until my last breath,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.90,1:03:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,so all you need to do...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.74,1:03:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,is stay still...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.49,1:03:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and get lost when I tell you to.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.10,1:03:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- That was quick.\N- Of course it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.86,1:03:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is it?\N- It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.57,1:03:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't want to add fuel to the fire.\N- No, let me hear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.90,1:03:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.49,1:03:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know Secretary Kim\Nand I have become quite close?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.28,1:03:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We just spoke on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.48,1:03:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,"How are they doing? Do\Nyou think they reconciled?"
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.08,1:04:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,"Where are they going after work?\NDon't let them cross paths."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.96,1:04:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's what secretaries...\N- It's not just us.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.96,1:04:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,All the workers are dying too.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.84,1:04:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They liked it better when you didn't care,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.80,1:04:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but you've been having good and bad days lately.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.05,1:04:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough. It's best that I don't hear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.64,1:04:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You made me talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.47,1:04:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, there's one thing you can do for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.14,1:04:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- Remaining amicable.\N- Enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.85,1:04:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be best if you went on a trip.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.60,1:04:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- Abroad, if possible.\N- Aren't you busy?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.15,1:04:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am. I'm your secretary.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.53,1:04:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're having dinner with Mr. Yoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.28,1:04:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're seeing him often.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.99,1:04:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it great?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.79,1:04:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No split levels.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.45,1:04:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,An entry fee of 8% isn't bad,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.21,1:04:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but why does he want Hercyna\Nto hire their own employees?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.38,1:04:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his rule.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.59,1:04:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- The workers need to be 27 or younger.\N- I know, but why?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.51,1:04:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't want old\Nemployees to sell his products.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.31,1:04:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.43,1:05:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so terrible about aging?\NIt's actually a blessing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.60,1:05:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's great and something to vie for.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.69,1:05:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.48,1:05:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's obnoxious.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.49,1:05:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,So will you give up then? He\Naccepted almost all our conditions.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.62,1:05:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,"Our"?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.21,1:05:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your conditions.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.79,1:05:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he accepted my conditions...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.38,1:05:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,for your sake,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.34,1:05:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,so tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.43,1:05:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.64,1:05:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.98,1:05:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel uneasy, since you're\Nnot asking me for a favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.48,1:05:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's something I can do\Nright now, then I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.40,1:05:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Divorce him.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.20,1:05:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Divorce Baek Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.20,1:06:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.33,1:06:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He was planning to leave you.\NWill you still keep him?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.60,1:06:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my business.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.01,1:06:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crossing the line again.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.73,1:06:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I really cross the line this time?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.44,1:06:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.03,1:06:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,replaced him?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.34,1:06:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be crossing the line\Nif I really asked you that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.15,1:07:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.95,1:07:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't digest food well when I'm offended.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.95,1:08:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was adopted by a Korean family at 12.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.41,1:08:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The U.S. may be vast, but\Nthe Korean community is small.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.87,1:08:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Our new international attorney\Nused to live in his neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.17,1:08:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They weren't close, but\Nhis family was well-known.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.96,1:08:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- How so?\N- It was soon after he was adopted.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.13,1:08:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,His adoptive parents moved to a bigger house.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.13,1:08:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they sent him to the\Nmost expensive private school.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.76,1:08:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hill Crawford Academy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.05,1:08:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The annual tuition costs over $60,000,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.35,1:08:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but his parents weren't rich.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.27,1:08:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you reach his parents?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.27,1:08:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I did look into it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.35,1:08:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They both passed away.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.06,1:08:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a drunk-driving accident,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.11,1:08:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but people thought it was odd,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.40,1:08:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,since neither of them were drinkers.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.99,1:09:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.91,1:09:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How is this place? It was empty for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.71,1:09:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.79,1:09:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel reassured to know my son is\Nliving under the same roof as me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.59,1:09:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.30,1:09:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- You need to be more careful, Ms. Moh.\N- Don't call me that. Call me "Mom."
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.10,1:09:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me not to call you that,\Nso I held myself back all along.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.18,1:09:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can't even say it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.15,1:09:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.40,1:10:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We had quite a past.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.03,1:10:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't regret it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.87,1:10:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? When this is your life right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.87,1:10:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}She's a housekeeper.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.12,1:10:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}She's been here for a while.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.67,1:10:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}You could say she's like...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.17,1:10:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}the head housekeeper who Grandfather relies on.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.71,1:10:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Don't mind her.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.84,1:10:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}She's a nobody.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.30,1:10:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}And over there...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.89,1:10:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Gosh, that's salty.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.97,1:10:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ms. Moh has lost her touch.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.64,1:10:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Why is this so salty?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.18,1:10:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}That's why you should kick her out this instant.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.27,1:10:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I would've done that\Nalready if it was up to me.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.02,1:10:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Eat up. The other dishes are fine.\N- Okay.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.24,1:10:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't you remember everything...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.44,1:10:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,you've lost in the past 30 years?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.37,1:10:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.62,1:10:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to keep my son close,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.29,1:10:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and raise him myself,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.21,1:11:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but if I did, you wouldn't\Nhave gotten nice birthday meals,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.13,1:11:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,or brand-new school uniforms.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.09,1:11:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We would've been dirt-poor.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.68,1:11:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I would've said, "We're family. Hang in there."
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.26,1:11:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,"Things will look up soon,"
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.55,1:11:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but that wouldn't have happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.90,1:11:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a nice house, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.65,1:11:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chairman Hong is very meticulous.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.40,1:11:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It took him five years to build this house,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.65,1:11:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,when it would've taken others one year.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.70,1:11:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He even chose which stones to put in the garden,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.83,1:11:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but soon...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.58,1:11:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll kick them all out,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.96,1:11:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and have this house to ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.80,1:11:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think it's unfair.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.13,1:11:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just changing the order of things.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.01,1:11:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This family had everything they ever wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.64,1:11:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They were happy,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.06,1:11:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and now...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.68,1:12:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll take over...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.98,1:12:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and become happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.73,1:12:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're more careless than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.53,1:12:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think it'll be easy?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.07,1:12:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}- I...\N- No, there it goes.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.24,1:12:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Kick the ball to me.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.53,1:12:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}I want to do it too.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.99,1:12:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}It's over there.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.58,1:12:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Guys, have a drink.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.12,1:12:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Mommy brought drinks.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.08,1:12:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}- Let's go.\N- Can we have it now?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.79,1:12:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Can we really drink it?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.96,1:12:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Come here!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.05,1:12:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Goodness, my princess.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.30,1:12:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Are you up?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.64,1:12:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Goodness, you're so pretty.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.52,1:12:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}{\i1}Goodness.{\i0}{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.44,1:12:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Beom-jun, be careful.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.36,1:12:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Guys, look here.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.82,1:12:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}- Carry me.\N- Sure.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.53,1:12:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Chairman Hong enjoyed his happiness before us,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.74,1:12:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and he still remembers those times.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.61,1:12:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't taken them away yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.37,1:12:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}You won't fall.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.37,1:12:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't be...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.79,1:12:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,complacent like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.55,1:13:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is this?\N- Use it however you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.55,1:13:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where can I possibly use this?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.68,1:13:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Secretary Jang told me you'll\Nbe investigated for the secret fund.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.98,1:13:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your son or grandson can't go to prison for you,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.60,1:13:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,since they have a lot on their plate.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.23,1:13:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- So?\N- I'll go instead.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.40,1:13:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's say I secretly\Nembezzled your secret fund...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.53,1:13:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,through the scholarship foundation.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.28,1:13:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm neither a board member\Nnor your family by law.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.33,1:13:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If I take responsibility, you won't\Nhave to worry about the owner's risk.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.08,1:13:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if the media covers it,\NI can take the fall alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.46,1:13:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no honor I need to keep,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.59,1:13:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.26,1:13:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be interrogated and go to prison instead.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.72,1:13:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.15,1:14:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're much better...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.94,1:14:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,than all my children combined.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.66,1:15:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.04,1:15:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you out in the cold? Where's your car?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.17,1:15:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it? Where is Mr. Oh?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.65,1:15:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.15,1:15:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How did I get here?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.32,1:15:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I keep finding myself like this these days.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.91,1:15:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Time keeps slipping away when\NI'm running out of time as it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.33,1:15:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.13,1:15:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know I was here?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.13,1:16:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you recognize this umbrella?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.64,1:16:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember giving it to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.06,1:16:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I was really dumbfounded back then.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.27,1:16:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.52,1:16:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that look.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.61,1:16:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a 51% chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.40,1:16:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can go to Germany and receive treatment.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.13,1:16:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.21,1:16:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep calling me?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.20,1:17:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. You know Ye-na, right? She\Ngot into a car accident two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.87,1:17:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She fainted and went to the ED.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.33,1:17:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}She fainted and went to the ED.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.33,1:17:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Then her husband...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.25,1:17:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Then her husband and her attorney rushed over.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.13,1:17:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He caused a scene and said\Nshe had to revise her will.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.63,1:17:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He was so noisy that she woke up.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.44,1:17:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.40,1:17:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.57,1:17:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.92,1:17:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you that worried?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.88,1:18:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.82,1:18:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Baek Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.78,1:18:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.83,1:19:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Her name is Yeong-suk.\N- Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.12,1:19:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- I recognize that name.\N- Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.01,1:19:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That was ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.43,1:19:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still calling for her?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.18,1:19:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queens Department Store Guide Map{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.39,1:19:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Baek, did you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.27,1:19:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A raccoon lives on our rooftop garden.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.06,1:19:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.15,1:19:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no raccoons in Seoul.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.40,1:19:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw her.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.32,1:19:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Many times.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.07,1:19:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.07,1:19:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She only comes out of hiding when\Nit's empty and you call her name.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.79,1:19:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She comes out?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.50,1:20:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.67,1:20:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You must take me for a fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.96,1:20:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.13,1:20:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name is Yeong-suk.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.06,1:20:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lying, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.81,1:20:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Call out her name when no one's around,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.23,1:20:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,but she only comes out when she wants.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.53,1:20:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Don't lie.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.12,1:20:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.04,1:20:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so adorable.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.38,1:20:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fooling me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.38,1:20:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.26,1:20:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She has big, round eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.34,1:20:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you'll love her too.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.81,1:21:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but you're not fooling me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.57,1:21:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a fool. He still believes it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.24,1:21:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he believe everything I say?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.12,1:21:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder he married me after I said...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.04,1:21:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd make him happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.93,1:21:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeong-suk.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.84,1:21:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out if you're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.72,1:21:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeong-suk?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.41,1:21:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeong-suk!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.33,1:22:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see you, Yeong-suk.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.51,1:22:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen of Tears{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.71,1:22:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}He ran laps, and had rice soup again.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.21,1:22:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Is this fun?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.84,1:22:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}How could I possibly leave her?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.55,1:22:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Get out.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.55,1:22:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}A reunion? A bar? There's only one answer.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.68,1:22:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}A mistress.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.47,1:23:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Why are you still here and\Nletting them humiliate you?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.35,1:23:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}That today will be...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.56,1:23:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}the best day of my life.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.48,1:23:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}She'll choose me anyway.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.11,1:23:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}You! Let her go!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.82,1:23:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}...and if you try to harm her,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.53,1:23:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I'll do the same to you.{\i0}
